  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 adds OpenTelemetry tracing: captured requests and queries are emitted as spans on the \"AspNetDebugDashboard\" ActivitySource, so adding that source to your tracer forwards them to Aspire or any OTLP backend. There's also a new companion MCP server (AspNetDebugDashboard.Mcp) that lets coding agents query the captured data. Nothing in the existing setup changes.",
